1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,166
The name on the receipt is mine

2
00:00:03,233 --> 00:00:05,166
I also wrote the notes

3
00:00:05,166 --> 00:00:06,433
But whether that little boy

4
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:07,866
from 15 years ago is Fu Chenzhou

5
00:00:07,866 --> 00:00:09,366
I can't just make him owe me a favor

6
00:00:09,633 --> 00:00:11,633
Your past should be returned to you by evidence

7
00:00:11,633 --> 00:00:12,800
Not claimed by me

8
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:15,033
Mrs. Fu, you are quite exceptional

9
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,300
Mr. Qin

10
00:00:16,466 --> 00:00:18,633
I just feel that identity and favors

11
00:00:18,633 --> 00:00:20,033
aren't things you can steal

12
00:00:20,633 --> 00:00:21,633
Seeing you not fight for it

13
00:00:22,266 --> 00:00:23,800
even when you have all the evidence

14
00:00:24,566 --> 00:00:25,800
Just because I have the evidence

15
00:00:26,066 --> 00:00:27,833
doesn't mean I should dictate the outcome

16
00:00:27,833 --> 00:00:29,500
If you really were that person back then

17
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:30,900
I want you to know the truth

18
00:00:31,166 --> 00:00:32,100
But I don't want you to feel

19
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,900
obligated to me because of the truth

20
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,266
We are already married

21
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,666
I want you to stay by my side

22
00:00:36,666 --> 00:00:37,666
because you want to

23
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,433
not because you owe me

24
00:00:40,066 --> 00:00:41,566
From now on, tell me first

25
00:00:41,766 --> 00:00:42,900
I'll help you find the evidence

26
00:00:43,233 --> 00:00:44,566
One ginkgo leaf pendant

27
00:00:44,966 --> 00:00:46,566
One original hospital receipt

28
00:00:46,833 --> 00:00:48,233
One piece of dark blue fabric

29
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,966
Please state how you obtained these

30
00:00:49,966 --> 00:00:52,200
items along with the time and place

31
00:00:52,966 --> 00:00:55,033
Mr. Qin, I was just too anxious

32
00:00:55,033 --> 00:00:56,866
Being anxious doesn't change where they came from

33
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Mr. Fu, I didn't mean to lie to you
